notes = "(!) Put the ROMs in RetroArch's system directory, with these names (upper case).|(!) FMT_SYS.ROM, FMT_DOS.ROM, FMT_FNT.ROM and FMT_DIC.ROM are required; the core does not start without them. FMT_F20.ROM is optional (a blank one is used).|(!) Instead of the separate files, a combined FMT_ALL.ROM is also accepted.|(!) MYTOWNS.ROM (serial ROM) and the FM Towns Marty's MAR_EX0-3.ROM are optional.|(!) Load a game's .cue (or .ccd/.mds/.iso), or a floppy image; several discs or floppies go in an .m3u.|(!) The FM Towns desktop is mouse driven: use the frontend's mouse, or the keyboard/joypad mouse emulation."

description = "A port of Tsugaru (TOWNSEMU), CaptainYS's FM Towns emulator, to libretro: CD-ROM, floppy and hard disk images, FM and PCM sound with CD audio, gamepads, mouse and keyboard, save states and disc swapping."
